ted last week](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14414).\r\nI added more details in the proposal but in short, I needed a way to know when audio effects are moved around or removed. I created three new signals and added them in the class reference:\r\n\r\n- `effect_moved(old_bus_index: int, old_effect_index: int, new_bus_index: int, new_effect_index: int)`\r\n- `effect_created(bus_index: int, effect_index: int)`\r\n- `effect_removed(old_bus_index: int, old_effect_index: int)`\r\n\r\nIt's my first time contributing, hope I didn't make mistakes :)\r\n\r\nThis resolves godotengine/godot-proposals#14414 .\r\n\r\nHave a nice day !","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id